  2+  9200              ; PROJECT127 - ATM Turbo 2+ DS12887 RTC service
  3+  9200              ; Version: P127_ATM_RTC v0.1.0
  4+  9200              ;
  5+  9200              ; Native ATM/GLUK interface (Project125/126 reference):
  6+  9200              ;   EFF7 bit 7: open DS12887 register gate
  7+  9200              ;   DFF7: register index
  8+  9200              ;   BFF7: register data
  9+  9200              ;
 10+  9200              ; The driver is read-only: it never writes DS12887 registers.
 11+  9200              ; The gate is closed through the documented TR-DOS ROM trampoline and
 12+  9200              ; DOSEN/RG6 state is restored before returning.
 13+  9200              ;
 14+  9200              ; API:
 15+  9200              ;   P127_RTC_Init: probes Status D/A; A=1 available, A=0 unavailable,
 16+  9200              ;                  carry set when unavailable.
 17+  9200              ;   P127_RTC_ReadTime: A=hour (0..23), B=minute, C=second; carry on error.
 18+  9200              ;   P127_RTC_SelfTest: tests conversion vectors only; no hardware writes.
 19+  9200              ;
 20+  9200              ; DS12887 Status B selects BCD/binary and 12/24-hour formats.
 21+  9200              ; =========================================================================
